      "name": "BK Miles",
      "created_at": "2021-03-26T15:56:52.485Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As I create Items in my system I want to tell the system which warehouse will be the default for each item.</p>\n<p>I want perishable items to go into the perishable warehouse and non-perishable items to go into the regular products warehouse. I want to be able to tell the system which warehouse to use as I create the item.</p>\n<p>I do not see a field for this in the Item master as I am creating the new Items.</p>\n<p>Am I missing something?</p>\n<p>~BKM</p>",
